.SS "int thumbnail_plugin_data_get (thumbnail_plugin * tp, void ** data)"
.PP
lets a thumbnailer-plugin get its private data this data persists from call to call, but not from session to session and is normally used to store a pointer to memory allocated when the plugin was initialized, so it may be free()d when the plugin is unloaded 
.PP
\fBReturns:\fP
.RS 4
an error-code 
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fItp\fP the plugin 
.br
\fIdata\fP where to store from the plugin-struct
.RE
.PP

.SS "int thumbnail_plugin_data_set (thumbnail_plugin * tp, void * data)"
.PP
lets a thumbnailer-plugin set private data this data persists from call to call, but not from session to session and is normally used to store a pointer to memory allocated when the plugin was initialized, so it may be free()d when the plugin is unloaded 
.PP
\fBReturns:\fP
.RS 4
an error-code 
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fItp\fP the plugin 
.br
\fIdata\fP the data to store on the plugin-struct
.RE
.PP

